@startuml
title StudyFlow | Task status lifecycle
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFD
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontColor #14213B
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #506383
skinparam stateBorderColor #345279
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #EDF5FF
skinparam stateStartColor #345279
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF6DB
skinparam noteBorderColor #A17E3B

state TODO
state IN_PROGRESS
state COMPLETED
[*] -down-> TODO : create
TODO -right-> IN_PROGRESS : start
IN_PROGRESS -left-> TODO : return to to-do
TODO -down-> COMPLETED : complete
IN_PROGRESS -down-> COMPLETED : complete
COMPLETED -up-> TODO : reopen

note bottom of IN_PROGRESS
  A task is overdue when it has a deadline
  before today and its status is incomplete.
end note
note bottom of COMPLETED
  First completion of a recurring root task
  commits one successor with the status change.
  Reopening preserves the generation record.
end note
@enduml
